abstract: >-
  BabelBetes is the largest open-source data standardization
  pipeline for clinical diabetes trial datasets, currently
  normalizing approximately 500,000 subject-days of paired
  CGM and insulin pump delivery data across a variety of
  high quality publicly available datasets. It solves the
  "last mile" problem of inconsistent data formats, giving
  researchers and sponsors immediate access to shovel-ready
  data and accelerating innovation in type 1 diabetes care.
